    "q-113919": {
      "dom_id": "step-q113919",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "$\\int 4\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 4\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
