      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "$\\int 2{sec}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int {sec}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta +C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 2{sec}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =2\\int {sec}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
